getChars()

Description: Copies characters into an array.

Program:

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String s="Hello";
        char[] c=new char[5];
        s.getChars(0,5,c,0);
        System.out.println(c);
    }
}

Output:

Hello

